tionary shift in how philosophy was done. In the 18th century, \"Y\" didn't just mean complaining; it meant to investigate, analyze, and reflect on the limits of something. By naming his book a \"Y\", he was declaring that he wasn't just building another metaphysical system; he was setting up a \"court of law\" where Reason itself would be put on trial to determine exactly what it can and cant know.  Id X and his famous work Y.", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-22T16:45:29Z", "username": "Nikhil Borra", "text": "Kant", "role": "attempt", "is_correct": false, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-22T16:45:30Z", "username": "Kartikey Pradhan", "text": "Kant", "role": "attempt", "is_correct": false, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-22T16:45:30Z", "username": "Abhishek Saluja", "text": "Kant", "role": "attempt", "is_correct": false, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-22T16:45:32Z", "username": "Abhishek Saluja", "text": "Reason", "role": "attempt", "is_correct": false, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-22T16:45:32Z", "username": "Kartikey Pradhan", "text": "Critique", "role": "attempt", "is_correct": false, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-22T16:45:40Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "critique of pure reason", "role": "attempt", "is_correct": false, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-22T16:46:01Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "Critique is Y and Kant is X", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-22T16:46:12Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "another great question", "role": "attempt", "is_correct": false, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-22T16:46:15Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "Immanuel Kant was born on this day in 1724", "role": "hint", "is_co